{"meta":{"id":"tt1566501","type":"movie","name":"Cristiada","imdb_id":"tt1566501","description":"Esta película se ubica en el tiempo presidencial de Plutarco Elías Calles, justamente unos años después de la revolución mexicana, en donde este presidente buscaba la represión religiosa castigando así a todos los sacerdotes y practicantes, en un intento por eliminarlos. En un principio crea leyes donde dice que no pueden hacer publicas sus practicas o vestimentas, pero en cuanto la otra parte no esta conforme con esto y se niega a obedecer este mandato se comienza a usar la fuerza bruta, fusilando y torturando a estas personas para dar el “ejemplo” y que la gente lo deje de hacer.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt1566501.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aHPEtpwRQgl84vLKUmVss45duZV.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jVIVKcI956k0QnN1Lov7LWrwxig.png","genres":["Historia","Drama","Acción","Bélica"],"releaseInfo":"2012","released":"2012-06-01T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"143 min","imdbRating":"6.6","country":"Mexico, United States of America","cast":["Eva Longoria","Andy Garcia","Oscar Isaac","Peter O'Toole","Rubén Blades","Catalina Sandino Moreno","Mau Kuri","Adrian Alonso","Eduardo Verástegui","Nestor Carbonell","Santiago Cabrera","Jorge Luis Moreno","Ignacio Guadalupe","Bruce Greenwood","Bruce McGill","Roger Cudney","Ceci Flores","José Sefami","Harold Torres","Fernanda Urdapilleta"],"director":["Dean Wright"],"writer":["Michael Love"],"trailers":[{"source":"J4R205D3SMY","type":"Trailer","name":"Cristiada (2012) TRAILER","ytId":"J4R205D3SMY","lang":"es"},{"source":"3KiagxENUv4","type":"Trailer","name":"For Greater Glory | Available on DVD/Blu-ray/On Demand 9.11","ytId":"3KiagxENUv4","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"J4R205D3SMY","title":"Cristiada (2012) TRAILER"},{"ytId":"3KiagxENUv4","title":"For Greater Glory | Available on DVD/Blu-ray/On Demand 9.11"}],"links